{
  "id": "M015",
  "title": "You Must Treat Me to Dinner",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2022-01-19",
  "synopsis": "Lili tells Lucy about her and Ben.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/90015/269a3783c34cf1ccd24673290aa9af3cb4e882e0.mp3?1637914727",
  "series": {
    "title": "Ben’s Life After Graduation",
    "chapter": 14,
    "totalChapters": 29
  },
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "你一定要请客哦\n\n丽丽：露西，你知道吗？本和我表白啦！\n露西：真的吗？太好了！你同意了吗？\n丽丽：嗯，我同意了。\n露西：恭喜，恭喜！这么好的事情，你一定要请客！\n丽丽：好啦！你想吃什么？\n露西：我要……吃火锅！",
    "traditional": "你一定要請客哦\n\n麗麗：露西，你知道嗎？本和我表白啦！\n露西：真的嗎？太好了！你同意了嗎？\n麗麗：嗯，我同意了。\n露西：恭喜，恭喜！這麼好的事情，你一定要請客！\n麗麗：好啦！你想吃什麼？\n露西：我要……吃火鍋！"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "You Must Treat Me to Dinner"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "丽丽：露西，你知道吗？本和我表白啦！",
      "traditional": "麗麗：露西，你知道嗎？本和我表白啦！",
      "pinyin": "lì lì lù xī nǐ zhī dào ma běn hé wǒ biǎo bái la",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: Lucy, guess what! Ben confessed his feelings to me!"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "露西：真的吗？太好了！你同意了吗？",
      "traditional": "露西：真的嗎？太好了！你同意了嗎？",
      "pinyin": "lù xī zhēn de ma tài hǎo le nǐ tóng yì le ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lucy: Really? That’s awesome! Did you accept?"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "丽丽：嗯，我同意了。",
      "traditional": "麗麗：嗯，我同意了。",
      "pinyin": "lì lì en wǒ tóng yì le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: Yes, I did!"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "露西：恭喜，恭喜！这么好的事情，你一定要请客！",
      "traditional": "露西：恭喜，恭喜！這麼好的事情，你一定要請客！",
      "pinyin": "lù xī gōng xǐ gōng xǐ zhè me hǎo de shì qing nǐ yí dìng yào qǐng kè",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lucy: Congrats, congrats! That’s such great news! You must treat me to dinner!"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "丽丽：好啦！你想吃什么？",
      "traditional": "麗麗：好啦！你想吃什麼？",
      "pinyin": "lì lì hǎo la nǐ xiǎng chī shén me",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: Alright! What do you want to eat?"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "露西：我要……吃火锅！",
      "traditional": "露西：我要……吃火鍋！",
      "pinyin": "lù xī wǒ yào chī huǒ guō",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lucy: I want to … eat hotpot!"
    }
  ],
